    [q]
  );
  res.json(rows);
});
```

The fork worth calling out: this handles typo-free keyword matching well but not fuzzy/typo-tolerant search. If "misspelled query tolerance" turns out to be a requirement, add `pg_trgm` for trigram similarity as a fallback — that's the next level down, not needed to ship the core feature.

